                        {
                          "type": "basic",
                          "name": "Span",
                          "props": {
                            "className": "shrink-0 text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-1 rounded text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-700"
                          },
                          "text": "{{item.board_name ?? ''}}"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "basic",
                          "name": "H3",
                          "props": {
                            "className": "shrink-0 text-sm font-medium text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500 italic"
                          },
                          "text": "$t:mypage.scrap.deleted_post"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "basic",
                          "name": "Span",
                          "props": {
                            "className": "shrink-0 text-xs font-semibold px-2 py-1 rounded text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-900"
                          },
                          "text": "$t:mypage.scrap.deleted_flag"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "basic",
                      "name": "Div",
                      "props": {
                        "className": "flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "basic",
                          "name": "Span",
                          "text": "{{item.author_name ?? ''}}"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "basic",
                          "name": "Span",
                          "text": "{{item.scrapped_at ?? ''}}"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "comment": "스크랩 해제 버튼 줄 (카드 하단 우측 정렬, 확인 모달 경유) — 삭제된 카드도 동일하게 정리 가능(확정 13). PC 표와 동일하게 텍스트 버튼",
                  "type": "basic",
                  "name": "Div",
                  "props": { "className": "flex justify-end mt-1" },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "basic",
                      "name": "Button",
                      "props": {
                        "type": "button",
                        "className": "text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1 rounded-md border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 hover:text-red-600 dark:hover:text-red-400 transition-colors cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap"
                      },
                      "actions": [
                        {
                          "type": "click",
                          "handler": "sequence",
                          "actions": [
                            {
                              "handler": "setState",
                              "params": {
                                "target": "global",
                                "scrapDeleteModal": {
                                  "id": "{{item.id}}",
                                  "title": "{{item.is_deleted ? '' : (item.title ?? '')}}",
                                  "isDeleted": "{{item.is_deleted}}"
                                }
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "handler": "openModal",
                              "target": "scrap_delete_modal"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ],
                      "text": "$t:mypage.scrap.table.remove"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "comment": "스크랩 목록 없음 (항상 노출 탭 — 빈 상태 안내, 확정 03) — 마이페이지 마일리지 탭과 동일한 카드 박스로 감싼다",
          "type": "basic",
          "name": "Div",
          "if": "{{!scrap.data.data || scrap.data.data.length === 0}}",
          "props": { "className": "flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 p-8 text-center" },
          "responsive": {
            "portable": {
              "props": { "className": "flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 p-6 text-center" }
            }
          },
          "children": [
            { "type": "basic", "name": "Icon", "props": { "name": "bookmark", "size": "3x", "className": "mx-auto text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-600 mb-3" } },
            { "type": "basic", "name": "P", "props": { "className": "text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400" }, "text": "$t:mypage.scrap.empty" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "comment": "페이지네이션 — 마이페이지 문의내역 탭과 동일하게 항상 노출 (1페이지뿐이어도 표시)",
          "type": "composite",
          "name": "Pagination",
          "props": {
            "currentPage": "{{scrap.data.pagination.current_page ?? 1}}",
            "totalPages": "{{scrap.data.pagination.last_page ?? 1}}",
            "className": "pt-4 flex justify-center"
          },
          "actions": [
            {
              "event": "onPageChange",
              "handler": "sequence",
              "actions": [
                { "handler": "setState", "params": { "target": "local", "scrapPage": "{{$args[0]}}" } },
                { "handler": "refetchDataSource", "params": { "dataSourceId": "scrap" } }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
